		{"id":"uncertainty","type":"text","x":0,"y":609,"width":460,"height":154,"color":"2","text":"### Uncertainty\n\n- Long-term data are thin\n- Group rankings are not prescribing guidance\n- Quality of life did not move with symptoms"},
		{"id":"hypothesis","type":"text","x":0,"y":823,"width":460,"height":232,"color":"6","text":"### Open questions\n\n- What distinguishes adult-onset presentations from childhood-onset ones?\n- How should objective measures complement rating scales in assessment?\n- How do arousal-state effects translate into human cognitive performance?"},
